    {"id":"3731ae7b-ff17-4118-bcf3-16fedecf87b3","name":"Sticky Note e528d633","type":"n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote","typeVersion":1,"position":[1728,1168],"parameters":{"content":"## Lead Qualification (Chat + SMS)\nOne AI Agent (with per-session memory) conducts the 6-question qualification over either the website chat widget webhook or inbound SMS, always replying in structured JSON (done/reply/fields/score) via a Structured Output Parser. Once done=true, HOT (80-100) holds a consultation slot + notifies front desk + adds a Drive folder & Contact; WARM (50-79) schedules a front-desk callback; COLD (0-49) starts an educational drip continued by the daily nurture scheduler (Data Table \"leads_nurture\" replaces long Wait nodes). Note: if the Emergency Capture workflow is also connected to the same Twilio number, both workflows will fire on every inbound SMS -- route by keyword or use separate numbers in production.","color":6}}
